        <detaileddescription>
<para>Configurable TTL for abandoned transactions. The coordinator must abort any <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_tx_handle" kindref="compound">TxHandle</ref> whose <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_distributed_tx_coordinator_1afdaeef254ee1ba3d0135057ca8122547" kindref="member">begin()</ref>-to-now duration exceeds this value, even if the handle was never explicitly committed or aborted. Returns zero duration if no TTL enforcement is applied (transactions are never forcibly timed out by the coordinator, relying solely on explicit <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_distributed_tx_coordinator_1a43a7e6f5dc3e0ac229db105741864dd5" kindref="member">abort()</ref> or <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_tx_handle" kindref="compound">TxHandle</ref> destruction). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
